TimeUntilEntranceOpen [SimTalk] - Mixer
Returns the time until the entrance of the Mixer designated by <Path> opens again after the recovery time
has elapsed.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.TimeUntilEntranceOpen → real
Return Value
The return value has the data type real.
Example
print MyMixer.TimeUntilEntranceOpen
See also
EntranceOpen [SimTalk] - Mixer
Attributes of the Mixer
Attributes of the Mixer
